%%PageBoundingBox:    0     0   326   256
%%BeginPageSetup
N
0 0 M
325.5 0 L
325.5 256 L
0 256 L
cp
clip
1.00 GC
0 256 325.5 256 325.5 0 3 0 0 DPLF
[     1 0 0    -1 0   253] CT
